docs {
 Downloads a specific manifest by name.

   The name must match the format returned by the list endpoint:
   {integrationType}-manifest-{x.y.z}-{YYMMDDhhmmss}. A malformed name is
   rejected as 400 before any lookup, which also guards against path traversal.
   A well-formed but unknown name returns 404.

   See "List manifests - invalid product" for the 400 case and
   "Get manifest by name - unknown name" for the 404 case.
}